  "contentval": "0005uzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzz",
  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/dSQv/366",
  "contentHtml": "<p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">삼각형 무게중심 팽이 만들기</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">(</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">아래 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">358</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">번 방</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">)</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">에서 출발하여 오각형</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">(360)</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">으로 갔다가</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">, </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">오각형 팽이 설명에 오개념</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">이 있어 거기<span style=\"color: #333333; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">(361)</span>까지 하고 멈추었습니다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">이번에는 사각형 무게중심 팽이 만들기입니다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">. </span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">영문 자료는 충북대학교 인도네시아 교육봉사단으로 출국</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">(2026.1.20.~2.17.)</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">했던 수학교육과 김○수 학생이 제작한 것입니다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">.</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/425d5eb847918b4a0f2ce07687dee0614cb6e325\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/425d5eb847918b4a0f2ce07687dee0614cb6e325\" data-origin-width=\"382\" data-origin-height=\"326\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">저는 인솔 교사로 동반하였기 때문에</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">, </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">현지 학생이 이 수업에 얼마나 흥미롭게 참여하였는지 잘 알고 있습니다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">그래서 우리도 활용하면 좋겠다는 생각이 들어 자료를 올립니다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">학생 각자 사각형 팽이를 하나씩 만들지만</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">, 저는 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">설명을 위해 같은 사각형을 여러 개 준비하였다는 점 참조하고 보시면 되겠습니다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">. </span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">1. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">사각형으로 자르기</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7249fdaf713f46c8064eeea997be127105273ae5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7249fdaf713f46c8064eeea997be127105273ae5\" data-origin-width=\"800\" data-origin-height=\"600\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">2. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">사각형에 대각선을 그어 두 개의 삼각형</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">(</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">①</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">, </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">③</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">)</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">으로 나누기</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bd6346c8dbfa141b28f8769daf84334307f6918c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bd6346c8dbfa141b28f8769daf84334307f6918c\" data-origin-width=\"800\" data-origin-height=\"600\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">3. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">이번에는 다른 꼭지점을 이은 대각선을 그어 두 개의 삼각형</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">(</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">②</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">, </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">④</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">)</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">으로 나누기</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7eb8edaf7634d94f49f1bb47453bc54786967c06\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7eb8edaf7634d94f49f1bb47453bc54786967c06\" data-origin-width=\"800\" data-origin-height=\"600\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">4. 2</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">와 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">3</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">에서 각 삼각형의 무게중심 찾기</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ff74f0673974d083dfd94e0659c767e577700c08\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ff74f0673974d083dfd94e0659c767e577700c08\" data-origin-width=\"800\" data-origin-height=\"600\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cc14422ca922463a0cf1af31d9820407f4713706\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cc14422ca922463a0cf1af31d9820407f4713706\" data-origin-width=\"800\" data-origin-height=\"600\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">5. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">①</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">과 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">③</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">, </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">②</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">와 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">④</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">의 무게중심을 선분으로 잇기 </span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">※ </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">무게중심을 이은 선분 두 개가 만나는 지점이 사각형의 무게중심</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4eb16add8989233d4f8073ba6b4f6f22ffaba8db\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4eb16add8989233d4f8073ba6b4f6f22ffaba8db\" data-origin-width=\"800\" data-origin-height=\"600\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">6. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">팽이심을 무게중심에 연결하고 돌리기</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">※ </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">여유 된다면</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">, </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">팽이의 윗면에 색칠하여 돌리기</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">(</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">빛의 합성</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">)</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a1fe925b5cdb5fa592c066dced51a25a7e799941\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a1fe925b5cdb5fa592c066dced51a25a7e799941\" data-origin-width=\"800\" data-origin-height=\"600\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
